---
source: tests/cli_root.rs
expression: out
---
Test Slack upload with a file

Usage: qam slack test [OPTIONS] <file>

Arguments:
  <file>  File to upload

Options:
      --channel <channel>  Slack channel or user (overrides default)
      --config <path>      Path to config file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/camsnap/config.yaml)
      --message <message>  Message to post
  -h, --help               Print help
